  "humanDescription": "This large apiary accepts three frames and pushes bees beyond their limits. Eighteen watts boost resources and drones by 20%; queen lifespan falls to 80%.\n^blue;Lower input: Power^reset;\n^blue;Upper input: Item network input^reset;\n^red;Output: Item network output^reset;",
  "apexDescription": "A three-frame productivity experiment. Power increases output while the queen pays with a shortened life and the frames wear normally.\n^blue;Lower input: Power^reset;\n^blue;Upper input: Item network input^reset;\n^red;Output: Item network output^reset;",
  "avianDescription": "Three frames drive this colony past its safe limits. Electricity hastens production, but frames still wear and the queen ages quickly.\n^blue;Lower input: Power^reset;\n^blue;Upper input: Item network input^reset;\n^red;Output: Item network output^reset;",
  "floranDescription": "Three frame make beesss work hard. Power makesss more loot; frame breakss and queen getsss old early.\n^blue;Lower input: Power^reset;\n^blue;Upper input: Item network input^reset;\n^red;Output: Item network output^reset;",
  "glitchDescription": "Analytical. Three frame slots increase available frame bonuses. Eighteen watts grant 20% more resources and drones; normal frame wear remains.\n^blue;Lower input: Power^reset;\n^blue;Upper input: Item network input^reset;\n^red;Output: Item network output^reset;",
  "hylotlDescription": "A spacious but severe apiary that accepts three frames. Its power increases output while the colony and frames endure normal strain.\n^blue;Lower input: Power^reset;\n^blue;Upper input: Item network input^reset;\n^red;Output: Item network output^reset;",
  "novakidDescription": "Three frames fit in this big rig. Eighteen watts gets the bees moving faster, but frames wear out and the queen burns out quick.\n^blue;Lower input: Power^reset;\n^blue;Upper input: Item network input^reset;\n^red;Output: Item network output^reset;",
  "genericDescription": "Accepts three frame slots. 18 W grants 20% more resources and drones; frames wear normally and queen lifespan is 80%.\n^blue;Lower input: Power^reset;\n^blue;Upper input: Item network input^reset;\n^red;Output: Item network output^reset;"
